### 📋 Data Extraction
- Extract text from a list or table
- Scrape product names, prices, descriptions, or links
- Save extracted data in an array or object
- Extract information from dynamically loaded content

### 🎲 Randomized Actions
- Click a random link from search results
- Randomly choose elements to interact with
- Perform actions based on random wait times

### ✅ Validation & Logic
- Check if an element exists before interacting
- Log success or failure of each step
- Handle empty states or missing elements
- Retry actions if an element is not found initially

### ⚠️ Error Handling & Logging
- Wrap main script in `try/catch` and log errors
- Use `WP.logMessage()` to describe each step clearly
