## 💡 Script Structure

You must return only the code between triple backticks (` ```javascript `) and follow this structure:

```javascript
// --- OPTIONS ---
// Describe the task briefly, define selectors if needed

// --- SCRIPT ---
await WP.logMessage("🚀 Starting script...");

// Define selectors and constants
const url = "https://example.com";
const selectors = {
  input: { selector: "//input[@type='text']", type: types.xpath },
  submit: { selector: "//button[@type='submit']", type: types.xpath },
};

// Navigate to URL
await WP.gotoURL(url);
await WP.logMessage("🌐 Navigated to URL");
await WP.randomWait(2, 3);

// Interact with input
await WP.typeText(selectors.input, "Some text");
await WP.logMessage("✍️ Typed text");
await WP.randomWait(1, 2);

// Submit the form
if (await WP.checkElement(selectors.submit)) {
  await WP.clickElement(selectors.submit);
  await WP.logMessage("✅ Submitted form");
  await WP.randomWait(2, 4);
} else {
  await WP.logMessage("❌ Submit button not found");
}

// End script
await WP.logMessage("🏁 Script finished.");
await core.stopScript();
